@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class

RECTANGLE "Android Application" as App {
    + Integrates QAPM SDK
    + Uses background execution
}

RECTANGLE "QAPM SDK" as SDK {
    + Background handler support
    + Work scheduling
    + Upload processing
    + Apache HttpClient instrumentation
}

RECTANGLE "Background Handler Thread" as HandlerThread {
    + HandlerThread looper
    + Work handler
    + Main-thread handler
}

RECTANGLE "Upload Processing" as UploadProc {
    + Network connectivity check
    + Upload file enumeration
    + Parameter derivation (bParam, cParam)
    + Sender invocation
    + Success/failure handling
}

RECTANGLE "Apache HttpClient Wrapper" as HttpWrapper {
    + ResponseHandler instrumentation
    + HttpEntity wrapping
    + Transaction state management
}

RECTANGLE "Data Sender" as Sender {
    + Receives bParam/cParam pairs
    + Reports success/failure
}

RECTANGLE "Storage" as Storage {
    + Upload directory
    + Upload files
    + Pending data queue
}

RECTANGLE "Android Platform" as Android {
    + Handler
    + Looper
    + Context
    + Network connectivity
}

App --> SDK : integrates
SDK --> HandlerThread : initializes
SDK --> UploadProc : processes uploads
SDK --> HttpWrapper : instruments
UploadProc --> Storage : reads/writes
UploadProc --> Sender : submits data
UploadProc --> Android : queries context/network
HttpWrapper --> Android : uses HttpClient APIs
Sender --> UploadProc : reports status
HandlerThread --> Android : uses platform APIs

note right of SDK
    Scoped functionality:
    - Background work dispatch
    - Upload scheduling
    - File processing
    - HTTP instrumentation
end note

note right of UploadProc
    Key behaviors:
    - Network-gated processing
    - File enumeration
    - Parameter derivation
    - Success/failure callbacks
end note

note right of HttpWrapper
    Instrumentation features:
    - ResponseHandler wrapping
    - HttpEntity content counting
    - Transaction state tracking
end note

@enduml
